sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Android client
  participant H as Regnant host
  participant DB as Host SQLite
  A->>H: Discover or select host
  H-->>A: Host address and certificate
  Note over A,H: User enters host-displayed short-lived pairing code
  A->>H: Pair request over TLS
  H->>H: Validate expiry, attempts and single-use state
  H->>DB: Store device identity and token hash
  H-->>A: Device token and host identity
  A->>A: Persist credential using encrypted storage
  A->>H: Authenticated HTTPS/WSS request
  H->>DB: Verify device and capability
  H-->>A: Result or event stream
